# Commands

- `pnpm run build`: Build the project
- `pnpm run check-types`: Run the typechecker
- `pnpm check:fix`: Lint and fix code
- `pnpm test`: Run tests (prefer single test files for speed)

# Code style

- Use ES modules (import/export), not CommonJS (require)
- Destructure imports when possible: `import { foo } from 'bar'`

# Workflow

- Always typecheck after making a series of code changes
- API routes go in `apps/server/src/index.ts` and `packages/api/src/index.ts` following existing patterns
